---
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10" aria-hidden="true">
    <div
      class="absolute -top-50 left-1/2 h-125 w-175 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 blur-[120px]"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="absolute top-45 -right-50 h-100 w-100 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/5 blur-[100px]">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100svh-4rem)] max-w-6xl items-center px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <div
        class="mb-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/3 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-400"
      >
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"> </span>

        Frontend Engineer · AI Builder
      </div>

      <h1
        class="max-w-4xl text-5xl leading-[1.05] font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
      >
        构建可靠的前端系统，

        <span
          class="bg-linear-to-r from-indigo-400 via-violet-400 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
        >
          探索 AI 应用的下一种形态。
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-zinc-400 sm:text-lg">
        在这里记录前端架构、工程化、性能优化、微前端以及 AI Agent 开发中的实践与思考。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/blog"
          class="rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-950 transition hover:bg-zinc-200"
        >
          阅读文章
          <span aria-hidden="true"> →</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href={siteConfig.links.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/2 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-white/6"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-zinc-600">
        <span>Vue</span>
        <span>TypeScript</span>
        <span>Astro</span>
        <span>Frontend Architecture</span>
        <span>AI Agent</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
